# Instance references class declared later in same dict.
# The Decl arm in collect_dependencies recursively collects dependencies from
# the instance's class reference, creating an edge Instance -> Class even when
# the class appears later in source order. SCC analysis ensures the class is
# processed before the instance.
[
  MyInstanceInt: [instance MyClass [pattern [a@Integer]]:
    my-method: [fn [let x] [+ x 100]]]

  MyClass: [class [let a]
    my-method: [Fn@Integer [a]]]

  use-instance: [fn [let x@Integer] [MyInstanceInt.my-method x]]
  result: [use-instance 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(142)
